Here is the commit message:
AMBARI-17772. Kerberos-related configs are not applied before
 INSTALL command is built on add service (rlevas)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the fact that Kerberos-related configurations were not being applied before the INSTALL command was built when adding a service. This led to situations where services could be improperly configured, resulting in failures during the installation process, especially when Kerberos was enabled for the cluster.

